; Like beancount's grammar, an account whose root is none of the account
; types in effect is reported on every line that writes it: an open, a
; metadata value, a posting and a balance assertion. The directives stay.
option "name_assets" "Activa"
2020-01-01 open Assets:A
  ref: Assets:A
2020-01-01 open Activa:B
2020-01-02 * "x"
  Assets:A   1 USD
  Activa:B  -1 USD
2020-01-03 balance Assets:A 1 USD
